  "description": "The v1 payloads of one MERGE fill. A FOK seller of 1,000 msat of NO in a binary market takes a resting Sell of YES at 380. The seller uses the public YES route, so its token side is Complement. The fill is in the taker's frame: path Merge, execution price 1000 - 380 = 620, and the canonical quote payment for 620 and the face. submitOrderResponse is the order part of the submit response. The order route can add settlementCapability to it, and the release 5 reader accepts that member. The engine contract tests check that the engine writes exactly submitOrderResponse and matchedDelta.",
